1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,272
This is our spot for the night.
这里就是我们今晚落脚的地方。

2
00:00:02,272 --> 00:00:05,962
To prepare for this overnight hike I packed just the basics.
为这次过夜徒步做准备，我只带了基本的东西。

3
00:00:05,962 --> 00:00:11,705
One single set of clothes a two person tent some dehydrated food and stuff to cook it with.
一套衣服、双人帐篷、一些脱水食品，还有煮东西用的物品。

4
00:00:11,705 --> 00:00:17,032
A sleeping bag and a sleeping mat and of course vilk's food and his sleeping bag and his gear.
睡袋和睡垫，当然还有 Vilk 的食物、睡袋和装备。

5
00:00:17,032 --> 00:00:26,722
Priorities excuse me down yes.
得分清轻重缓急。不好意思，下来，对。

6
00:00:27,112 --> 00:00:30,562
It's a bit of a change having to carry his stuff as well as mine.
除了我自己的东西，还要背他的，这确实是个变化。

7
00:00:30,562 --> 00:00:38,188
But I like to think that he pays me back in well positive vibes love kisses laughs free.
但我愿意觉得，他用积极的氛围、爱、亲亲和笑声来回报我。Free。

8
00:00:39,112 --> 00:00:51,462
That's definitely payment enough it is really about to rain so I have about two minutes to put the tent up.
这已经足够当报酬了。马上要下雨，我大概只有两分钟搭帐篷。

9
00:00:55,372 --> 00:01:07,440
Oh shit how the heck does this work come on come on come on almost there.
糟了，这到底怎么弄？快点快点快点，就差一点。

10
00:01:08,472 --> 00:01:14,016
Aw shit other way dammit vilk off.
哎，糟了，另一边，真是的。Vilk，下去。

11
00:01:17,212 --> 00:01:21,712
There's something so primal about being outside in a storm.
在暴风雨中待在户外，有种非常原始的感觉。

12
00:01:21,712 --> 00:01:28,012
You know we spend so much of our time indoors 93 of our lives according to some studies.
你知道，我们很多时间都待在室内；作者说，按一些研究，是一生的百分之九十三。

13
00:01:28,012 --> 00:01:33,743
And I catch myself getting comfortable turning up the heat in temperature controlled apartments.
我会发现自己贪图舒适，在温度可调的公寓里把暖气开高。

14
00:01:33,743 --> 00:01:36,472
Taking the conveniences for granted.
把这些便利当成理所当然。

15
00:01:36,472 --> 00:01:45,892
It's getting pretty chilly pretty quickly can you see that it's kind of pouring right now.
天很快变得很冷。能看到吗？现在雨下得很大。

16
00:01:45,892 --> 00:01:54,772
But you know what kinda crazy in here I mean vilk is pretty chill he is super tired after that hike.
但你知道吗，里面有点乱。我是说，Vilk 倒很淡定，刚走完那段徒步特别累。

17
00:01:54,772 --> 00:02:03,582
And there's just something so romantic about having dehydrated beans in a tent on a meadow in the rain.
在雨中的草地上，待在帐篷里吃脱水豆子，竟然有种浪漫。

18
00:02:06,532 --> 00:02:13,612
So getting out there even for very small adventures especially when it's cold and wet and stormy out.
所以，即使只是很小的冒险，走出去，尤其在外面又冷又湿、有暴风雨的时候……

19
00:02:13,612 --> 00:02:19,545
Oh I don't know it kinda reconnects me to something deeper inside myself.
哦，我也说不清，它好像让我重新连接到内心更深的东西。

20
00:02:21,532 --> 00:02:28,192
As fun as that hike was it left me with wet shoes wet socks wet trousers.
那段徒步虽然好玩，却让我鞋子、袜子、裤子都湿了。

21
00:02:28,192 --> 00:02:34,995
So I'm really really looking forward to taking these off and putting on a new fresh pair of socks so nice.
我特别期待脱掉这些，换一双干净的新袜子。太舒服了。

22
00:02:39,442 --> 00:02:44,032
In a world filled with so much virtual noise and mental distraction.
这个世界充满虚拟噪声和分散注意力的东西。

23
00:02:44,032 --> 00:02:51,052
I sometimes need to remind myself that this here this is what will always remain.
我有时得提醒自己，眼前这一切，才是会一直存在的东西。

24
00:02:51,052 --> 00:03:00,832
We could uninstall our social media apps throw away our phones and this here the hills and the mist and the rain they would still be here.
我们可以卸载社交媒体，扔掉手机，而眼前的山、雾和雨，仍会在这里。

25
00:03:06,122 --> 00:03:22,015
Vilk what is it huh it's just ducks it's a duck buddy.
Vilk，怎么了？嗯？只是鸭子，是一只鸭子呀，伙计。

26
00:03:25,672 --> 00:03:35,732
I hope there's a little break in the rain right now so I'm gonna take this opportunity and go and fill up my water cause there's a river right there.
希望现在雨暂时停一会儿，所以我想趁这个机会去装点水，因为那边有条河。

27
00:04:23,422 --> 00:04:30,772
Hey wait wait wait good boy come on bubba mhmm thank you very much.
嘿，等等，等等，等等。好孩子，来，小家伙。嗯，谢谢你。

28
00:04:30,772 --> 00:04:35,515
Go inside wait wait wait wait wait oh shit oh that didn't work.
进去，等一下，等等等等。哦，糟了，那没成功。

29
00:04:36,772 --> 00:04:42,625
Turns out that the hardest thing about camping with a dog might just be keeping the tent clean.
结果发现，带狗露营最难的，可能就是保持帐篷干净。

30
00:04:43,942 --> 00:04:51,354
Like once they're inside you wanna keep them inside you know cause my tent is currently a mud pit.
它们一进来，你就想让它们一直待在里面，你懂吧，因为我的帐篷现在成了泥坑。
